==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Trust Fund}}

==Battleground==
*12 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can permanently stall the Gabriels and Winged Pigge. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] outranges both and can take down Pigge decently quick. The rest of your budget needs to be spent on any shield breaker unit you own as both Aku enemies have lots of shields. Alternatively, if pushed back far enough, Ramen can also stall these two and chip down the base.

As you do not need a lot of different units, fill your first row with attack up [[Cat Combo]]s.

